				apple,tunable-agx-af-rd-bw-dvfs-filter = [fe 01 00 00];
				apple,tunable-agx-af-rd-bw-threshold = [00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 37 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 57 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 36 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 56 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 1e 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 57 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 1d 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 56 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 16 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 57 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 15 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 56 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 0a 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 57 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 09 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 56 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 57 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 56 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 14 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 13 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 06 00 00 00];
				apple,tunable-agx-af-wr-bw-dvfs-filter = [fe 01 00 00];
				apple,tunable-agx-af-wr-bw-threshold = [00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 37 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 57 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 36 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 56 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 1e 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 57 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 1d 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 56 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 16 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 57 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 15 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 56 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 0a 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 57 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 09 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 56 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 57 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 56 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 14 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 13 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 06 00 00 00];
