				apple,tunable-agx-dcs-bw-threshold = [00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 10 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 3c 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 0f 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 4c 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 3b 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 66 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 4b 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 65 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 0a 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 3c 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 09 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 4c 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 3b 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 66 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 4b 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 65 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 04 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 2c 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 03 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 4c 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 2b 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 57 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 4b 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 56 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 1a 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 26 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 19 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 57 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 25 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 56 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 0c 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 33 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 0b 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 32 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 20 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 1f 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 06 00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00