				apple,tunable-agx-dcs-lat-dvfs-filter = [00 00 00 00];
				apple,tunable-agx-dcs-lat-threshold = [20 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 10 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 90 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 c8 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 20 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 10 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 90 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 c8 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 20 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 10 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 90 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 c8 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 20 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 10 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 90 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 c8 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 20 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 10 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 90 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 c8 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 20 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 10 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 90 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 c8 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 20 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 10 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 90 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 c8 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 20 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 10 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 90 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 c8 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 20 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 10 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 90 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 c8 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 20 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 10 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 90 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 c8 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 20 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 10 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 90 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 c8 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 20 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 10 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 90 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 c8 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 20 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 10 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 90 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 c8 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 20 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 10 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 90 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 c8 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 20 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 10 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 90 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 c8 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 20 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 10 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 90 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 c8 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 20 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 10 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 90 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 c8 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 20 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 10 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 90 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 c8 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 20 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 10 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 90 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 c8 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 20 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 10 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 90 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 c8 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 20 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 10 00 00 00 0